In these three sections, the individual chapters present an explanation and discussion of the specific technologies/resources. The intention here is to inform the public and to engage readers, particularly those who might have an interest in becoming involved in this new and rapidly growing field. The document is therefore quite long. However, it has been laid out in such a way as to enable someone to get a quick overview of the field and to dip in and out of specific aspects that are of interest. For this reason, where possible, the chapters have a common format, covering for each topic the following questions, going from the simpler, more general, to the more detailed discussion.
